    "reason": "[ev-c5faeec10a04] says the default for ignoring status-field differences changed from `crd` to `all`. It also says setting `ignoreResourceStatusField: crd` in argocd-cm `resource.compareoptions` keeps the v2 behaviour. So the exposed environments are those upgrading from before 3.0 whose argocd-cm does not set ignoreResourceStatusField, which is exactly the proposed exposure. The proposed overlap, an explicit `crd` pin, matches the shield the evidence documents.",
